              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waisraeli waligeuka wakafuata njia iendayo Bashani. Mfalme Ogu wa Bashani akatoka na jeshi lake kuwashambulia huko Edrei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini Mwenyezi-Mungu akamwambia Mose, “Usimwogope, maana nimemtia mikononi mwako pamoja na watu wake wote na nchi yake yote. Utamtendea kama ulivyomtendea Sihoni, mfalme wa Waamori, aliyekuwa anakaa Heshboni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Waisraeli wakamuua Ogu, wanawe na watu wake wote, bila kumwacha hata mtu mmoja, kisha wakaitwaa nchi yake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.35",
